OL,3,ALib Dems would cut income tax, says Ed
OL,4,ADavey in conference speech
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiberal Democrat leader Ed Davey says
OL,7,Fhis party would cut income tax
OL,9,FHe says his party would raise the
OL,10,Ftax-free personal allowance to #15,000
OL,11,Fif it was in power, paid for by
OL,12,Feconomic growth
OL,14,FHe continues that his party would raise
OL,15,Fthe higher rate tax band threshold to
OL,16,F#56,000
OL,18,FHe also says his party would support
OL,19,Frejoining the single market
